this for loop over 'point_emitter' runs zero times on every pass of the loop on line 11 after the first: you made 'point_emitter' outside that loop, and this for loop takes every item from it on the first pass. Make the emitter inside the loop, just before this for loop (point_emitter: &ListEmitter[S64] <- points.emitter()), so each pass walks the collection from its start
